    "Browse…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "浏览…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Built for HPC / cluster logins. You'll need your 2FA **secret key** (the TOTP setup key) — SSH2FA types the codes. It does **not** work with Duo Push / approve-on-phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "专为 HPC / 集群登录设计。你需要 2FA 的**密钥**（TOTP 设置密钥）—— 验证码由 SSH2FA 输入。它**不支持** Duo Push / 手机点确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can't reach the server — check Wi-Fi or VPN.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法连接到服务器 —— 请检查 Wi-Fi 或 VPN。"
