    "Checks GitHub about once a day for a newer release and flags it in the menu bar. Never downloads or installs anything on its own — the About tab shows one-step update instructions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大约每天检查一次 GitHub 上的新版本，并在菜单栏标记。绝不会自行下载或安装 —— “关于”标签页会给出一步到位的更新说明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose “Always Allow” on each prompt": {
      "localizations": {
