    "Name": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name for this folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文件夹的名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs a TOTP secret key — **not Duo Push** (approve-on-phone). Paste the otpauth:// URL or the bare base32 secret, or screenshot the QR and click “Scan QR”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要 TOTP 密钥 —— **不是 Duo Push**（手机点确认那种）。粘贴 otpauth:// 链接或纯 base32 密钥，或者截图二维码后点“扫描二维码”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs a TOTP secret key — not Duo Push. Re-enrol the account in your 2FA provider's device page to get a fresh key.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要 TOTP 密钥 —— 不是 Duo Push。请在你的 2FA 服务商设备页面重新注册该账户以获取新密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
