    "Reveal the stored password": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示已保存的密码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs each time this tunnel transitions to alive. Env: AUTO2FA_TUNNEL_NAME, AUTO2FA_LOCAL_PORT, AUTO2FA_NODE, AUTO2FA_JUMP, AUTO2FA_URL.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次此隧道变为存活时运行。环境变量：AUTO2FA_TUNNEL_NAME、AUTO2FA_LOCAL_PORT、AUTO2FA_NODE、AUTO2FA_JUMP、AUTO2FA_URL。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH ControlMaster pool + 2FA login + SLURM-aware port forwarding": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH ControlMaster 连接池 + 2FA 登录 + 感知 SLURM 的端口转发"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH password": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH 密码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH2FA": {},
    "SSH2FA Logs": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH2FA 日志"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH2FA is free & open source. The one missing piece is an Apple Developer membership ($99/yr). With it the app can be notarized — it installs with zero Gatekeeper warnings for everyone, plus signed updates and a Homebrew cask that just works. If SSH2FA saves you the daily 2FA dance, chip in toward the $99.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH2FA 是免费开源的。唯一缺的是 Apple 开发者会员（每年 99 美元）。有了它 App 就能完成公证 —— 所有人安装时都不会有 Gatekeeper 警告，还能有签名更新和开箱即用的 Homebrew cask。如果 SSH2FA 帮你省掉了每天的 2FA 折腾，欢迎为这 99 美元出一份力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH2FA is locked": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH2FA 已锁定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH2FA manages this host's ssh config entry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此主机的 ssh 配置条目由 SSH2FA 管理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH2FA on GitHub": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub 上的 SSH2FA"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH2FA refers to each host by its ~/.ssh/config alias. Add your first one and enter its password + 2FA secret — that's it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH2FA 通过 ~/.ssh/config 中的别名来识别每台主机。添加第一台并输入密码 + 2FA 密钥，就这么简单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH2FA uses a small background helper to keep your connections alive. Leave this on unless you run it yourself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH2FA 用一个小型后台助手来维持你的连接。除非你自己运行它，否则请保持开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH2FA's background helper was updated, so macOS will ask permission to use each saved password and 2FA secret. Do it in one go now — choose “Always Allow” on each prompt. They'll then be merged into a single Keychain item, so future updates ask only once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH2FA 的后台助手已更新，macOS 会为每个已保存的密码和 2FA 密钥询问权限。现在一次性处理完 —— 每个弹窗都选“始终允许”。之后它们会合并成单个钥匙串条目，以后更新只会问一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Save": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存"
          }
        }
      }
