    },
    "The first one is what plain “Mount” uses.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第一个是“挂载”默认使用的文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first one is what plain “Mount” uses. “Auto” mounts it as soon as the host connects.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第一个是“挂载”默认使用的文件夹。“自动”会在主机连上后立即挂载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The stored 2FA secret can't be read": {
